WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.130
My God, my God, why have you forsaken me?

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.780
It is a cry of pain that
comes from the Bible itself.

3
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.610
Christians believe Jesus prayed
these same words on the cross.

4
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:18.120
Today, earthquakes, floods and wars
still raise that same question: why?

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.800
So why do earthquakes and wars make
some people doubt that an all-powerful,

6
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.880
loving God exists?

7
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:28.160
In this mission, you'll sort
suffering into two kinds,

8
00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.310
from earthquakes to bullying.

9
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:35.330
Then you'll test three short questions
credited to the Greek philosopher Epicurus.

10
00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:40.280
Your mission: explain why suffering
makes some people doubt that God exists.
